#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:561
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Training and coordination"
msgstr "Training and coordination"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:565
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"We train naval cadets in routine and specialized functions aboard space "
"vessels and coordinate naval activity throughout the sector."
msgstr ""
"We train naval cadets in routine and specialised functions aboard space "
"vessels and coordinate naval activity throughout the sector."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:569
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The original station builders were fans of the late 20th-century scientist "
"and author Isaac Asimov. The station was initially named Foundation. It "
"started as a stellar observatory, then became a supply stop, and as it has "
"grown has become the region's educational and coordination hub."
msgstr ""
"The original station builders were fans of the late 20th-century scientist "
"and author Isaac Asimov. The station was initially named Foundation. It "
"started as a stellar observatory, then became a supply stop, and as it has "
"grown has become the region's educational and coordination hub."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:583
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Warp and impulse engine manufacturing"
msgstr "Warp and impulse engine manufacturing"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:587
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"We manufacture warp, impulse, and jump engines for the Human Navy fleet as "
"well as other independent clients on a contract basis."
msgstr ""
"We manufacture warp, impulse, and jump engines for the Human Navy fleet as "
"well as other independent clients on a contract basis."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:591
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station is named after the 19th-century astronaut as well as the "
"fictionlized stations that followed. The station initially constructed "
"spaceworthy vessels, but over time it transitioned into specializing in "
"propulsion systems."
msgstr ""
"The station is named after the 19th-century astronaut as well as the "
"fictionlized stations that followed. The station initially constructed "
"spaceworthy vessels, but over time it transitioned into specialising in "
"propulsion systems."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:604
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Warp drive components"
msgstr "Warp drive components"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:608
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We provide warp drive engines and components."
msgstr "We provide warp drive engines and components."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:612
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"This station is named after Chris Van Den Broeck, who did some initial "
"research into the possibility of warp drives in the late 20th century on "
"Earth."
msgstr ""
"This station is named after Chris Van Den Broeck, who did some initial "
"research into the possibility of warp drives in the late 20th century on "
"Earth."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:626
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Shielded circuitry fabrication"
msgstr "Shielded circuitry fabrication"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:630
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"We make a large variety of circuits for numerous ship systems shielded from "
"sensor detection and external control interference."
msgstr ""
"We make a large variety of circuits for numerous ship systems shielded from "
"sensor detection and external control interference."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:634
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"Our station is named after the law which quantifies the amount of force with "
"which stationary electrically charged particals repel or attact each other, "
"a fundamental principle in the design of our circuits."
msgstr ""
"Our station is named after the law which quantifies the amount of force with "
"which stationary electrically charged particals repel or attact each other, "
"a fundamental principle in the design of our circuits."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:649
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:2508
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Sensor components"
msgstr "Sensor components"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:653
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We research and manufacture sensor components and systems"
msgstr "We research and manufacture sensor components and systems"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:657
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station is named after Tony Heyes, the inventor of some of the earliest "
"electromagnetic sensors in the mid-20th century on Earth in the United "
"Kingdom, which aided in mobility for blind humans."
msgstr ""
"The station is named after Tony Heyes, the inventor of some of the earliest "
"electromagnetic sensors in the mid-20th century on Earth in the United "
"Kingdom, which aided in mobility for blind humans."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:670
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Nanite supplier"
msgstr "Nanite supplier"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:674
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We provide nanites for various organic and non-organic systems."
msgstr "We provide nanites for various organic and non-organic systems."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:678
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"This station is named after the Israeli nanotechnologist Hossam Haick, from "
"the early 21st century on Earth."
msgstr ""
"This station is named after the Israeli nanotechnologist Hossam Haick, from "
"the early 21st century on Earth."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:693
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:731
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Energy beam components"
msgstr "Energy beam components"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:697
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We research and manufacture energy beam components and systems."
msgstr "We research and manufacture energy beam components and systems."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:701
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station is named after Theodore Maiman, who researched and built the "
"first laser in the mid-20th century on Earth."
msgstr ""
"The station is named after Theodore Maiman, who researched and built the "
"first laser in the mid-20th century on Earth."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:713
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:2649
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Gambling and resupply"
msgstr "Gambling and resupply"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:717
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "The oldest station in the quadrant."
msgstr "The oldest station in the quadrant."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:735
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We manufacture energy beam components."
msgstr "We manufacture energy beam components."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:739
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"Station named after Guglielmo Marconi, an Italian inventor from early 20th-"
"century Earth who, along with Nikola Tesla, claimed to have invented a death "
"ray or particle beam weapon."
msgstr ""
"Station named after Guglielmo Marconi, an Italian inventor from early 20th-"
"century Earth who, along with Nikola Tesla, claimed to have invented a death "
"ray or particle beam weapon."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:752
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Exobiology research"
msgstr "Exobiology research"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:756
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We study recently discovered life forms not native to Earth"
msgstr "We study recently discovered life forms not native to Earth"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:760
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"This station was named after one of the early exobiologists from mid-20th-"
"century Earth, Dr. Stanley Miller"
msgstr ""
"This station was named after one of the early exobiologists from mid-20th-"
"century Earth, Dr. Stanley Miller"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:773
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1044
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1616
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:2555
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Impulse engine components"
msgstr "Impulse engine components"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:777
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We research and manufacture impulse engine components and systems."
msgstr "We research and manufacture impulse engine components and systems."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:781
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station is named after Roger Shawyer, who built the first prototype "
"impulse engine in the early 21st century."
msgstr ""
"The station is named after Roger Shawyer, who built the first prototype "
"impulse engine in the early 21st century."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:792
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Energy and particle beam components"
msgstr "Energy and particle beam components"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:796
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We fabricate general and specialized components for ship beam systems."
msgstr "We fabricate general and specialised components for ship beam systems."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:800
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"This station was named after Archimedes, who, according to legend, used a "
"series of adjustable focal length mirrors to focus sunlight on a Roman naval "
"fleet invading Syracuse and set fire to it."
msgstr ""
"This station was named after Archimedes, who, according to legend, used a "
"series of adjustable focal length mirrors to focus sunlight on a Roman naval "
"fleet invading Syracuse and set fire to it."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:815
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1153
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1833
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Trading station"
msgstr "Trading station"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:819
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"Only the largest market and trading location in twenty sectors. You can find "
"your heart's desire here."
msgstr ""
"Only the largest market and trading location in twenty sectors. You can find "
"your heart's desire here."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:823
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"Modeled after the early 21st-century bazaar on Earth in Bangkok, Thailand. "
"Designed and built with trade and commerce in mind."
msgstr ""
"Modelled after the early 21st-century bazaar on Earth in Bangkok, Thailand. "
"Designed and built with trade and commerce in mind."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:831
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:2571
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Mining"
msgstr "Mining"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:834
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"We mine nearby asteroids for precious minerals and process them for sale."
msgstr ""
"We mine nearby asteroids for precious minerals and process them for sale."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:838
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"This station's name is inspired by a large gold mine on Earth in Indonesia. "
"The station builders hoped to have a similar amount of minerals found "
"amongst these asteroids."
msgstr ""
"This station's name is inspired by a large gold mine on Earth in Indonesia. "
"The station builders hoped to have a similar amount of minerals found "
"amongst these asteroids."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:851
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Observatory and stellar mapping"
msgstr "Observatory and stellar mapping"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:855
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"We study the cosmos and map stellar phenomena. We also track moving "
"asteroids. Look out! Just kidding."
msgstr ""
"We study the cosmos and map stellar phenomena. We also track moving "
"asteroids. Look out! Just kidding."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:859
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"Station named in honor of Charles Hayden, whose philanthropy continued "
"astrophysical research and education on Earth in the early 20th century."
msgstr ""
"Station named in honour of Charles Hayden, whose philanthropy continued "
"astrophysical research and education on Earth in the early 20th century."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:869
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:2384
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Autodoc components"
msgstr "Autodoc components"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:874
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station is named after Dr. Lipkin, who pioneered some of the research "
"and application around robot assisted surgery in the area of partial "
"nephrectomy for renal tumors in the early 21st century on Earth."
msgstr ""
"The station is named after Dr. Lipkin, who pioneered some of the research "
"and application around robot assisted surgery in the area of partial "
"nephrectomy for renal tumors in the early 21st century on Earth."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:884
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Zero-gravity sports and entertainment"
msgstr "Zero-gravity sports and entertainment"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:888
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "Take in a game or two, or perhaps see a show"
msgstr "Take in a game or two, or perhaps see a show"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:892
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"Named after Madison Square Garden from 21st-century Earth, this station was "
"designed to serve similar purposes in space as a venue for sports and "
"entertainment."
msgstr ""
"Named after Madison Square Garden from 21st-century Earth, this station was "
"designed to serve similar purposes in space as a venue for sports and "
"entertainment."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:905
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Shield components and research"
msgstr "Shield components and research"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:909
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We research and fabricate components for ship shield systems."
msgstr "We research and fabricate components for ship shield systems."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:913
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"This station was named after Rutherford Appleton Laboratory, a national "
"research institution in the United Kingdom on Earth, which conducted "
"preliminary research into the feasability of generating an energy shield in "
"the late 20th century."
msgstr ""
"This station was named after Rutherford Appleton Laboratory, a national "
"research institution in the United Kingdom on Earth, which conducted "
"preliminary research into the feasability of generating an energy shield in "
"the late 20th century."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:926
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Shield and armor components and research"
msgstr "Shield and armour components and research"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:930
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"We research and make general and specialized components for ship shield and "
"ship armor systems."
msgstr ""
"We research and make general and specialised components for ship shield and "
"ship armour systems."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:934
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"This station was named after Alexander Toohie, one of the earliest "
"researchers in shield technology, back when it was considered impractical to "
"construct shields due to the physics involved."
msgstr ""
"This station was named after Alexander Toohie, one of the earliest "
"researchers in shield technology, back when it was considered impractical to "
"construct shields due to the physics involved."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:948
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1427
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Battery and software engineering"
msgstr "Battery and software engineering"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:952
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"We provide high quality high capacity batteries and specialized software for "
"all shipboard systems."
msgstr ""
"We provide high quality high capacity batteries and specialised software for "
"all shipboard systems."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:956
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station was founded by a collective of electrical and software engineers "
"who distrusted third-party systems. They built their own from scratch, and "
"demand has kept them busy since."
msgstr ""
"The station was founded by a collective of electrical and software engineers "
"who distrusted third-party systems. They built their own from scratch, and "
"demand has kept them busy since."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:966
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Shield and armor research"
msgstr "Shield and armour research"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:970
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "The finest shield and armor manufacturer in the quadrant."
msgstr "The finest shield and armour manufacturer in the quadrant."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:974
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"Originally a military outpost, the station's fabrication bays were "
"repurposed for defensive systems production after an armistice. The quality "
"of their work has never declined."
msgstr ""
"Originally a military outpost, the station's fabrication bays were "
"repurposed for defensive systems production after an armistice. The quality "
"of their work has never declined."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:984
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1505
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Communication components"
msgstr "Communication components"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:988
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"We provide a range of communication equipment and software for use aboard "
"ships."
msgstr ""
"We provide a range of communication equipment and software for use aboard "
"ships."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:992
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station was first built as a deep-space relay outpost during the early "
"days of interstellar exploration. As the sector grew, so did this station, "
"eventually evolving into a full manufacturing hub for communication systems."
msgstr ""
"The station was first built as a deep-space relay outpost during the early "
"days of interstellar exploration. As the sector grew, so did this station, "
"eventually evolving into a full manufacturing hub for communication systems."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1007
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1544
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Robotic research"
msgstr "Robotic research"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1011
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We research and provide robotic systems and components."
msgstr "We research and provide robotic systems and components."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1015
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"A consortium of cyberneticists and mechanical engineers pooled their "
"resources to create a dedicated research center for autonomous systems. "
"Their breakthroughs in actuator design and decision algorithms are used "
"across the sector."
msgstr ""
"A consortium of cyberneticists and mechanical engineers pooled their "
"resources to create a dedicated research centre for autonomous systems. "
"Their breakthroughs in actuator design and decision algorithms are used "
"across the sector."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1023
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1580
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Advanced Material components"
msgstr "Advanced Material components"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1027
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"We fabricate several different kinds of materials critical to various space "
"industries, such as shipbuilding, station construction, and mineral "
"extraction"
msgstr ""
"We fabricate several different kinds of materials critical to various space "
"industries, such as shipbuilding, station construction, and mineral "
"extraction"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1031
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station began as a materials science lab investigating high-tensile "
"alloys for deep-space construction. Their discoveries led to a full "
"production line that now supplies construction firms across the sector."
msgstr ""
"The station began as a materials science lab investigating high-tensile "
"alloys for deep-space construction. Their discoveries led to a full "
"production line that now supplies construction firms across the sector."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1048
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We supply high-quality impulse engines and parts for use aboard ships"
msgstr "We supply high-quality impulse engines and parts for use aboard ships"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1052
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station was founded by a team of propulsion engineers who believed that "
"conventional thruster design had room for dramatic improvement. Their "
"iterative refinements have made them a trusted name in sublight travel."
msgstr ""
"The station was founded by a team of propulsion engineers who believed that "
"conventional thruster design had room for dramatic improvement. Their "
"iterative refinements have made them a trusted name in sublight travel."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1061
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1175
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1285
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1652
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1874
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:2092
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Android components"
msgstr "Android components"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1065
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "Supplier of android components, programming, and service"
msgstr "Supplier of android components, programming, and service"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1069
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"Founded by a cooperative of engineers who saw the growing demand for "
"synthetic laborers and companions. Their modular design philosophy makes "
"repairs and upgrades straightforward."
msgstr ""
"Founded by a cooperative of engineers who saw the growing demand for "
"synthetic laborers and companions. Their modular design philosophy makes "
"repairs and upgrades straightforward."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1077
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1196
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1687
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1910
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Transporter components"
msgstr "Transporter components"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1081
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"We provide transporters used aboard ships as well as the components for "
"repair and maintenance."
msgstr ""
"We provide transporters used aboard ships as well as the components for "
"repair and maintenance."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1085
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station was founded by the lead engineers from a defunct transporter "
"manufacturing conglomerate. When the parent company folded, they pooled "
"their severance and built a better facility from the ground up."
msgstr ""
"The station was founded by the lead engineers from a defunct transporter "
"manufacturing conglomerate. When the parent company folded, they pooled "
"their severance and built a better facility from the ground up."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1093
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1723
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Commerce and gambling"
msgstr "Commerce and gambling"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1097
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "Come play some games and shop. House take does not exceed 4 percent."
msgstr "Come play some games and shop. House take does not exceed 4 percent."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1101
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"What started as a single card table in a maintenance bay grew organically "
"into one of the busiest entertainment hubs in the sector. The original table "
"is still on display in the main atrium."
msgstr ""
"What started as a single card table in a maintenance bay grew organically "
"into one of the busiest entertainment hubs in the sector. The original table "
"is still on display in the main atrium."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1110
#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1757
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Xenopsychology training"
msgstr "Xenopsychology training"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1114
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"We provide classes and simulation to help train diverse species in how to "
"relate to each other."
msgstr ""
"We provide classes and simulation to help train diverse species in how to "
"relate to each other."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1118
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"Psychologists, sociologists, and xenobiologists founded this station as a "
"dedicated institute for interspecies communication. The curriculum has been "
"adopted by several naval academies."
msgstr ""
"Psychologists, sociologists, and xenobiologists founded this station as a "
"dedicated institute for interspecies communication. The curriculum has been "
"adopted by several naval academies."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1137
msgctxt "scienceDescription-station"
msgid "Casino and gambling"
msgstr "Casino and gambling"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1141
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "We never tell you the odds, because they're always in your favor!"
msgstr "We never tell you the odds, because they're always in your favour!"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1145
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"A front for an interstellar crime syndicate that launders and fences much of "
"its ill-gotten goods through this seedy hall of games."
msgstr ""
"A front for an interstellar crime syndicate that launders and fences much of "
"its ill-gotten goods through this seedy hall of games."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1157
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid ""
"Come to Crossway Bazaar for all your trade and commerce needs and desires!"
msgstr ""
"Come to Crossway Bazaar for all your trade and commerce needs and desires!"

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1161
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"Independent traders from a dozen systems formed a cooperative to establish "
"this central marketplace. Over time, permanent storefronts replaced the "
"temporary stalls, but the spirit of the bazaar remains."
msgstr ""
"Independent traders from a dozen systems formed a cooperative to establish "
"this central marketplace. Over time, permanent storefronts replaced the "
"temporary stalls, but the spirit of the bazaar remains."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1179
msgctxt "stationGeneralInfo-comms"
msgid "Androids and their parts, maintenance, and recycling."
msgstr "Androids and their parts, maintenance, and recycling."

#: scripts/place_station_scenario_utility.lua:1183
msgctxt "stationStory-comms"
msgid ""
"The station grew out of a small repair shop that specialized in synthetic "
"personnel. As demand for android labor increased, the facility expanded into "
"manufacturing and recycling."
msgstr ""
"The station grew out of a small repair shop that specialised in synthetic "
"personnel. As demand for android labour increased, the facility expanded "
